==German==

===Etymology===
From a {{bor|de|nds|-}} dialectalism {{m|nds|Ossenpesek|lit=ox pizzle}} from {{m|nds|Pese|t=tendon}}, {{m|nds|Peserik|t=rod}}, as a pizzle was used in the 18th century to beat man and animal.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|de|De-piesacken.ogg}}
* {{audio|de|De-piesacken2.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# to [[torment]], to [[bully]] with small but repeated acts
#: {{syn|de|ärgern|sekkieren|quälen|triezen}}
#: {{uxi|de|Hör auf, deine kleine Schwester zu '''piesacken'''!|t=Stop bullying your little sister!}}
#: {{uxi|de|Wir wurden die ganze Nacht von Mücken '''gepiesackt'''.|t=We were tormented by mosquitoes all night.}}

